Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.60,0:00:12.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,《斯巴达克斯：血与沙》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.00,0:00:16.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,《斩尽杀绝》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.70,0:00:38.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看着他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mind them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.60,0:01:09.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尊贵的Batiatus家族 一直谦虚恭谨!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The noble House of Batiatus stands humbled!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.10,0:01:12.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪怕有诸神的眷顾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Humbled by the blessings{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.86,0:01:15.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也始终谨言慎行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the gods have seen fit to shower upon us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.93,0:01:21.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡普亚最尊贵的市民们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And by the presence of the most revered citizens{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.93,0:01:23.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎你们的到来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in all of Capua,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.70,0:01:25.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我们共庆Claudius Glaber副将\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}come to join in celebrating the patronage{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.70,0:01:29.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对我们的资助!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of Legatus Claudius Glaber!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.96,0:01:31.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,副将因议院事务繁重 无法出席\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The man himself regrets the duties of the Senate{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.24,0:01:32.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对此 他表示遗憾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}prevent his attendance,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.56,0:01:34.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他已经将想要说的话 罗列成稿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but he would see us properly addressed,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.96,0:01:36.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并请他挚爱的妻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}his words delivered{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.06,0:01:38.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,向我们转述\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}by pleasing tongue of trusted wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.33,0:01:45.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位亲爱的卡普亚市民\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good citizens of Rome's favored sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.13,0:01:47.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很高兴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is with great pleasure that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.20,0:01:50.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由我 Claudius Glaber副将\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I, Legatus Claudius Glaber, bestow upon{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.36,0:01:52.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,向Quintus Lentulus Batiatus\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Quintus Lentulus Batiatus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.66,0:01:54.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给予资助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}my patronage,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.33,0:01:56.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,及其它附加利益\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and all encompassing benefits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.33,0:01:58.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡普亚上下 再无他人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No man in all of Capua is more deserving{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.93,0:02:01.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能享有如此尊贵的特权\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of such esteemed privilege.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.13,0:02:03.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这座连遭变故的城市\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good Batiatus should be held as example{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.03,0:02:05.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Batiatus应成为全市楷模\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to a city mired in shadows and treachery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.83,0:02:07.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用他的良善之心 为我们带来光明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The guiding light of his virtuous heart{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.80,0:02:11.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,指引大家驱散黑暗和烦恼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}providing illumination in these dark and troubling times.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.86,0:02:14.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,基于此 以及其它数不胜数的原因...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For this reason and too many others to give voice...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.76,0:02:16.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别轻举妄动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Still yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.03,0:02:18.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我将无条件地全权支持他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I lend my full and unconditional support{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.80,0:02:21.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迈向高贵的市政官之席\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to the honored position of Aedile.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.93,0:02:25.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Aemilia可没说过你有意参政\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Aemilia failed to mention you had mind towards office.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.66,0:02:27.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 Sextus 我承认\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, I admit to none, good Sextus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.36,0:02:29.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在副将提议之前 我的确没这想法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Until the Legatus broached the subject.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.10,0:02:34.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,市政官仅次于行政官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Aedile is but a breath below Magistrate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.00,0:02:35.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Um.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.80,0:02:38.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们吃饭去吧 边吃边聊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We should dine, and discuss the matter further.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.96,0:02:43.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Glaber副将和他的支持 令我激动万分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My heart to Legatus Glaber and his support.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.90,0:02:47.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我希望大家也能和我同享喜悦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In the hopes that you will share it in the coming days,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.43,0:02:50.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,特呈上鲜血之礼!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I present a gift of blood!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.46,0:02:52.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,竞技场的两位传奇人物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Two legends of the arena,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.63,0:02:55.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将在终极决斗中 一决高下!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to face each other sine missione!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.26,0:02:56.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不谈宽恕!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No quarter given!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.53,0:02:58.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不讲仁慈!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No mercy shown!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.90,0:03:01.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请看 Crixus!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Behold, Crixus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.76,0:03:04.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凶残的高卢人!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The savage Gaul!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.20,0:03:10.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,试问 有谁能与之匹敌呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And who shall attempt to tame him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.30,0:03:14.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只此一人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There can be but one man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.76,0:03:16.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.70,0:03:18.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,死亡之影的屠灭者!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Slayer of the Shadow of Death!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.16,0:03:28.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他真是无与伦比 对吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He is of a form, is he not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.23,0:03:32.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是神祇的化身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He stands a god.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.33,0:03:35.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Crixus啊...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Crixus...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.53,0:03:37.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我给过答复了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have given my answer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.86,0:03:39.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打完这场再说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let us finish this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.10,0:03:51.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Begin!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.10,0:04:20.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(2天前)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.96,0:04:29.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在玩火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You speak of dangerous things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.30,0:04:37.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们本来就活在水深火热之中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We live in dangerous times.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.43,0:04:44.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,许多人仍认为 Crixus才是我们真正的战神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Many yet hold Crixus our true Champion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.93,0:04:46.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也这么想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Count me among them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.56,0:04:53.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Doctore啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Doctore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.23,0:04:55.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我请求进行木桩练习\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would work the palus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.40,0:04:59.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯的请求 我批准了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Permission for Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.40,0:05:12.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你和Hamilcar商量过么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Have you traded words with Hamilcar?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.36,0:05:13.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他站在我们这边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He is with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.40,0:05:17.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但只要Crixus不表态\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But Castus and the other Gauls{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.53,0:05:19.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Castus和其他高卢人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}refuse to grab cock without{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.16,0:05:21.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也会不吱声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Crixus holding their balls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.43,0:05:23.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Rhaskos站在哪一边?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where does Rhaskos stand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.86,0:05:25.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和他们一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The same.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.96,0:05:28.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的人不多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Our numbers are yet shallow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.40,0:05:31.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们必须获得Crixus的支持\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We must gain Crixus' support{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.33,0:05:32.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,使队伍壮大起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and see them rise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.50,0:05:35.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可那家伙仍然被关着呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The fucking mad man's still under lock and key.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.13,0:05:37.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果不能跟他说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How will you turn him to cause{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.56,0:05:38.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又怎能让他同意起义?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if you cannot break words with him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.70,0:05:40.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,战神是有特权的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Being champion yet affords privilege.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.73,0:05:43.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们可以利用这一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A way shall present itself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.53,0:05:44.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说话啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Answer!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.53,0:05:46.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最好能快点儿"利用"起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It best "present" fucking soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.63,0:05:48.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说过要你站着吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did I tell you to stand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.73,0:05:56.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Glaber同意资助了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Glaber falls to patronage,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.66,0:05:57.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些名门望族 纷纷以我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and the men of influence greet me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.96,0:05:59.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马首是瞻!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as a fucking brother!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.30,0:06:02.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,辉煌的一天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A day of shining glory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.10,0:06:04.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,转眼即被乌云破坏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Marred by darkening cloud.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.03,0:06:06.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,主人 我有话想跟您说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I beg a word, Dominus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.96,0:06:08.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,私下谈谈吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In private.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.16,0:06:12.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Doctore啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Doctore,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.56,0:06:14.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别忧心忡忡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}well spill sour thoughts,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.80,0:06:16.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看事情 要看到好的一面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and hear them sweetened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.66,0:06:20.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Glaber的雇佣兵 对人无故鞭打\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Glaber's mercenaries punish absent cause.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.20,0:06:21.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都苦不堪言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The men suffer at their hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.96,0:06:23.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,必须把这口气咽下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is a burden that must be endured{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.30,0:06:25.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没时间去管这种琐事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have no time for such petty concerns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.63,0:06:29.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恕我直言 每个训练场都需要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}With respect, every ludus requires{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.03,0:06:31.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,角斗士主人给予高度重视\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the attention of its lanista.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.36,0:06:35.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要力争上游 站到比竞技场更高的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I seek a loftier title, one far removed from the arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.56,0:06:38.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您想让家族传统成为历史?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You would see your family's heritage a thing of memory?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.06,0:06:39.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.53,0:06:41.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是厌倦了尘土和单调\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet I tire of the dust and drudgery,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.96,0:06:44.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想找个更合适的人来接替我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and I would have my interests in blood and sand{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.63,0:06:49.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,继续将角斗士事业发扬光大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}overseen by someone with more attentive eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.03,0:06:51.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他必须一个永远忠诚的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Someone who has forever proven loyal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.10,0:06:56.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您想把训练场 委托给一个奴隶?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You would entrust the ludus to a slave?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.43,0:06:59.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不再是奴隶了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A slave, never.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.30,0:07:04.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我本打算留到庆典来宣布的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I had thought to make announcement at the celebration,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.20,0:07:06.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你既然问了 我就告诉你吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but you force my hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.16,0:07:09.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在拟定文书 打算赐你自由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My advocate is drawing up papers granting your freedom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.70,0:07:11.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自由?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Freedom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.10,0:07:12.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不再是我的Doctore\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No longer shall you be my Doctore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.40,0:07:14.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你将成为训练场主人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You will assume the mantle of lanista,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.73,0:07:16.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并可以使用自己的本名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and be warmly greeted by your name,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.43,0:07:18.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即Oenomaus\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oenomaus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.00,0:07:22.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以为你会为此感到高兴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I had thought the news to please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.40,0:07:23.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Apologies,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.73,0:07:27.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我听到一个传言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have heard rumor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.50,0:07:28.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,令我寝食难安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One that has vexed sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.70,0:07:31.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说吧 说出来就又能安睡了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well give voice, and dream again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.46,0:07:35.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我听说 Barca没有获得自由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Barca was not granted freedom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.93,0:07:38.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而是被你所杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Instead he met his end, at your hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.26,0:07:55.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个传言确有其事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The rumor is true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.60,0:07:57.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,却没交代清楚理由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet absent reasoning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.20,0:07:59.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我派Barca去给Ovidius\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Barca was dispatched to deliver{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.30,0:08:01.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,送个口信而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}a simple message to Ovidius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.56,0:08:03.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他却杀了Ovidius和他全家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Instead he slaughtered the man and his entire fucking family,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.76,0:08:05.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,简直目无法纪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}against command.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.43,0:08:08.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在行政官发现真相\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I had no choice but to take his life,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.60,0:08:10.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并把我们赶尽杀绝之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}before the Magistrate discovered the deed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.30,0:08:12.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我无路可选 只能杀了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and pulled us all to ruin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.50,0:08:13.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那Ashur呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And Ashur?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.53,0:08:16.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是否对该"选择"贡献颇多?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did he aid in this "choice"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.50,0:08:22.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等你成了角斗士主人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When you are lanista,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.53,0:08:23.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也会有面对这种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you shall also be faced with decisions{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.83,0:08:24.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两难抉择的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}grave of consequence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.96,0:08:28.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到时你就知道 什么叫两害相权取其轻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And know your measure by how your blade falls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.40,0:08:39.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能感觉到他蠢蠢欲动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Can you yet feel him move,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.23,0:08:41.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迫不及待地 想出来见见世面么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}eager to make entrance into the world?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.46,0:08:43.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么知道是个男孩?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How do you divine a boy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.66,0:08:46.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为天神眷顾我们啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Because the gods fucking favor us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.66,0:08:47.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Glaber的资助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Glaber's patronage,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.73,0:08:49.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我有望迈入卡普亚最高阶层\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}access to the upper strata of Capua,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.43,0:08:51.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成为政坛人物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the promise of political office.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.56,0:08:53.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的付出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Everything we have bled for,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.26,0:08:55.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终于有了回报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}finally within our grasp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.73,0:08:58.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们是真正受上天眷顾的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We are truly blessed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.56,0:09:01.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我今天宣布的消息 多么振奋人心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I deliver but glorious news this day,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.96,0:09:05.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可你却不愠不火!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to be met with tempered response!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.03,0:09:08.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别高兴过头 还有庆典在等着我们呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Joy is restrained to lend clear mind to celebration.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.96,0:09:12.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Glaber的资助 或许能为我们平步青云铺平道路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Glaber's patronage may have paved road to the elite,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.60,0:09:14.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但那些上层人士的胃口可不小\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but they are of ravenous appetite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.40,0:09:15.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你打算拿什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And what meal would you suggest{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.56,0:09:17.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去喂饱他们?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to see them sated?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.26,0:09:20.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Batiatus家族唯一能提供的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One that only the House of Batiatus can prepare.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.43,0:09:23.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让死亡之影的屠灭者 斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus, Slayer of Theokoles,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.36,0:09:25.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来一场死亡角逐赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in a contest to the death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.20,0:09:29.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们已经在Numerius的成年礼上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We have already presented such diversion{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.06,0:09:30.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,办过此类活动了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}at Numerius' Toga Virilis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.86,0:09:33.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Varro根本不配和卡普亚战神比试\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Varro was no match for the Champion of Capua.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.93,0:09:36.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们必须让他们看看 当晚没有出现的胜景\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We must give them what was denied that night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.50,0:09:38.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全卡普亚都翘首以待的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What all of Capua longs to see,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.20,0:09:40.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但只有我们这儿少数人有幸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but only a privileged few under our roof{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.30,0:09:41.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得以见到的胜景\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}may bear witness to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.80,0:09:43.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡普亚战神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Champion of Capua,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.90,0:09:46.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus in a fight for his life{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.63,0:09:50.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,与唯一屡战屡胜他的勇士 来场生死大对决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}against the only man who has ever defeated him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.70,0:09:53.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是你的期望?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is this your fucking hope?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.46,0:09:55.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让那个败落的高卢人有机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That the fallen Gaul is granted opportunity{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.00,0:09:56.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卷土重来?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to regain position?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.00,0:09:58.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.03,0:10:04.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你误会我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You mistake intent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.03,0:10:05.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要见到Crixus\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would see Crixus dead,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.53,0:10:06.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为冒犯Batiatus家族\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for offenses committed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.53,0:10:08.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,付出生命的代价\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}against the House of Batiatus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.13,0:10:10.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这点上 我们的立场倒是一致\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then we stand as one in such regard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.90,0:10:14.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的话 尚令我无法相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh your tongue named cause of doubt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.06,0:10:16.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Crixus是唯一对斯巴达克斯 造成威胁的角斗士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Crixus is the only gladiator to pose threat to Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.16,0:10:19.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当我竞选参政的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And there is yet political advantage{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.90,0:10:21.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亮出"送雨的使者"这张王牌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to parading the Bringer of Rain{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.86,0:10:24.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对我的政治生涯 将大为有利啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as I campaign for office.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.53,0:10:28.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们一定要确保斯巴达克斯获胜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then we must ensure Spartacus victorious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.80,0:10:32.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,则Crixus将被永远忘却\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And Crixus fades from memory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.36,0:10:45.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 你们退下吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That will be all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.53,0:10:50.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有了资助 束缚也随之而来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Patronage comes with unfortunate attachment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.70,0:10:53.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我深有体会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A fact I am well aware of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.93,0:10:56.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你最初的模样 仿佛还历历在目\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am reminded of the first time you stood before me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.60,0:10:59.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那时你是个野人 戴着镣铐 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in this office, a savage in chains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.96,0:11:02.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在你却直面死亡 毫无畏惧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now you stand as death, made meat and bone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.96,0:11:04.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你把我历练至此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It was your hand that forged my purpose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.86,0:11:07.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然而Batiatus家族如此兴旺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet it is upon your shoulders{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.03,0:11:09.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并将继续光耀万世\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the House of Batiatus has been so elevated,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.06,0:11:12.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全是你的功劳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and continues to rise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.66,0:11:17.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两天之后 我们将举办卡普亚最具影响力的盛事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Two days hence we play host to the most influential in Capua,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.33,0:11:20.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,庆祝成功得到资助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in celebration of patronage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.13,0:11:22.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尽管大家来参加庆典 是为了近身一睹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Although a closer look at the Slayer of Theokoles{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.23,0:11:24.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,死亡之影屠灭者的风采\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}be the true draw.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.26,0:11:25.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我非常荣幸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A great honor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.70,0:11:27.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其他角斗士也能一同出现在庄园内吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Will the men be displayed in the villa?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.90,0:11:31.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,副将会对此表示不悦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Legatus would frown upon such storied tradition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.00,0:11:33.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你和其他人的活动范围 将限定于广场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You and the others will be confined to the square.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.70,0:11:36.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的客人在哪里观赏呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And how will our guests have view?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.40,0:11:37.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,购买露台观看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}From purchase of the balcony.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.73,0:11:39.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没人能抵御\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No eye will be denied{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.26,0:11:40.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡普亚战神的英姿!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the Champion of Capua!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.86,0:11:44.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他将直面旗鼓相当的对手 浴血奋战!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As he faces his arch enemy in a match to the death!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.40,0:11:47.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要和Crixus对阵?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am to fight Crixus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.23,0:11:50.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你担心吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This concerns you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.30,0:11:52.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 我期待已久了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is long overdue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.86,0:11:56.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但杀掉困兽一般软弱的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet there is no honor{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.50,0:11:58.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,毫无荣耀可言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in taking the life of a caged lion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.80,0:12:00.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我希望他早日恢复训练\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would see him return to training,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.06,0:12:03.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样观众看他死亡才过瘾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}so he may better thrill the crowd before his end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.06,0:12:07.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想得真周全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You truly have fucking mind for this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.46,0:12:11.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Crixus该被放回去了 可只是为了接受训练而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Crixus shall be freed from bond yet only for training.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.83,0:12:13.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会任由这禽兽为所欲为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would not have the animal run free,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.90,0:12:15.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以免他再次狂性大发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}lest he again bares teeth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.93,0:12:16.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快去休息吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Remove yourself to slumber,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.93,0:12:19.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有梦才能成真\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and dreams of extracting them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.26,0:12:24.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起 主人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Apologies, Dominus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.13,0:12:28.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,与睡眠相比 我更需要...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There is something I crave more than sleep...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.36,0:12:44.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你所求之事 绝对办不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You ask the impossible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.70,0:12:46.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在我去见Batiatus之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The gates to the villa must stand open{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.06,0:12:48.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,庄园的门得一直开着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}before I make a move on Batiatus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.20,0:12:50.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要让我独自涉险啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You would have me risk all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.80,0:12:52.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And for what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.40,0:12:56.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了让斯达巴克斯报仇?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So that Spartacus may have his revenge?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.66,0:12:58.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.50,0:13:01.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样他的内心就会恢复平静了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So that his heart might find a measure of peace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.03,0:13:08.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她是这样的女人吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Was she such a woman,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.73,0:13:12.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说你的妻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}your wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.30,0:13:15.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她是我心中的太阳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She was the sun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.30,0:13:19.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,却已经陨落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Never to rise again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.56,0:13:21.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要否认她能温暖人心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A heavy thing,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.66,0:13:25.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,实属不易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to be denied its warmth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.00,0:13:28.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会确保届时大门敞开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will see the gate opened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.00,0:13:33.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我有个条件...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But I would have exchange...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.23,0:13:36.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的条件是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is my price.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.56,0:13:38.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,与我交欢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To feel you inside me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.26,0:13:44.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我多想感受到一丝 你对她炙热的爱恋...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To know pale shadow of the love that you felt for her...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.76,0:14:51.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才不会把赌注压在高卢人身上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would not have wagered the Gaul{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.86,0:14:53.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他对斯巴达克斯根本不成威胁!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}such a challenge to Spartacus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.76,0:14:55.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你小看他了 Aemilia\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You underestimate the man, Aemilia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.16,0:14:58.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Crixus是昔日的战神 不是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Crixus was once Champion, was he not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.50,0:15:00.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这场比赛才刚刚开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The match is but newly born.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.86,0:15:03.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们都难以预测结果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Much may yet happen as it matures.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.16,0:15:08.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 主人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Apologies, Domina.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.03,0:15:09.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我得去商店再买些酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I must gather more wine from the stores.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.70,0:15:11.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让别人去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Send another.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.60,0:15:13.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要伴我左右 招待宾客\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would keep you close, to attend the guests.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.46,0:15:30.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听我说...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You must listen to me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.26,0:15:42.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(1天前)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.96,0:15:48.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,主人要放我出去了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dominus has ordered my release?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.76,0:15:51.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是斯巴达克斯求他的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It was Spartacus that moved his hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.20,0:15:53.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.13,0:15:55.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他希望你在与他对战之时...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He desires you at your best...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.86,0:15:59.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,处于最佳状态\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}when you stand before him sine missione.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.83,0:16:02.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,众神终于显灵了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The gods finally answer my prayers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.70,0:16:05.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是早点显灵就好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Had they but answered sooner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.33,0:16:06.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天 在太阳落山时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You stand before him tomorrow,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.60,0:16:08.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你与他一战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as the sun fades.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.13,0:16:11.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算此时交战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If it were this very moment,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.36,0:16:13.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结果也是一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the outcome would not change.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.83,0:16:16.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我对Naevia许过诺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have made promise to Naevia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.96,0:16:24.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在获取自由之前 我不会死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will not die until I have gained my freedom,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.30,0:16:26.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她会重回我的怀抱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and she is in my arms again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.90,0:16:28.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们先别说自由的事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Delay talk of freedom,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.13,0:16:30.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等有望自由时 再谈不迟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}until there are ears that would welcome the sound.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.66,0:16:35.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我怕主人不愿给我自由啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I fear Dominus shall forever be deaf to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.36,0:16:40.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要有信念\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Place your faith to closer quarters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.30,0:16:43.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,主人使我摆脱了劳役之苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dominus releases me from the bonds of servitude,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.60,0:16:46.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我荣登角斗士主人之位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to assume mantle as lanista.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.00,0:16:52.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你实至名归\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is a title well deserved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.83,0:16:56.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我们携手 使这训练场重返辉煌...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Together we will restore honor to this ludus...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.50,0:16:59.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让Naevia与你团聚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and Naevia to your arms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.93,0:17:02.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯阻碍了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus but stands in your way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.50,0:17:05.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就把他打倒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then he shall fall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.36,0:17:13.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,举行庆典?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A celebration?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.66,0:17:15.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,届时精英汇聚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Filled with the elite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.23,0:17:17.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀了他们 卡普亚就乱套了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Their deaths will shatter Capua to chaos.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.26,0:17:18.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等他们回过神来追我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It'll be days before they regain senses{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.73,0:17:20.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都过去好几天了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to pursue us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.00,0:17:21.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的计划成型了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Our plan takes form.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.56,0:17:22.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那Crixus怎么办?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What of Crixus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.76,0:17:23.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还是得想办法 和那该死的高卢人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You still must find way to broach subject{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.96,0:17:25.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谈谈这个问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with the fucking Gaul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.50,0:17:28.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会有办法的 我保证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It presents itself, as promised.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.83,0:17:31.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,耶!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.03,0:17:32.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Crixus啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Crixus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.40,0:17:34.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Crixus啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Crixus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.16,0:17:36.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,耶!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.83,0:17:42.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我操\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fuck my ass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.66,0:17:43.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,万事俱备 只欠让你的宿敌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now all that remains is convincing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.73,0:17:46.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加入到我们的队伍中来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}a man that hates you to join your cause.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.40,0:17:53.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我该做的都做完了吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have seen task to completion?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.26,0:17:54.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我丈夫的资助使你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My husband's patronage has lifted{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.60,0:17:57.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,平步青云啊 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}your celebration beyond the heavens,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.20,0:17:59.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上层名流 全聚于此庆典\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}clouds bursting with honored guests.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.53,0:18:01.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Altius和他的侄子Gaius吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Altius and his cousin Gaius?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.16,0:18:02.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们是一定要来的...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They are a necessity...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.50,0:18:05.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,按你们所吩咐的 也会来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and are delivered, as commanded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.53,0:18:08.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Aemilia的丈夫 Sextus呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Aemilia's husband, Sextus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.56,0:18:10.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他虽已不是行政官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's a former magistrate,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.10,0:18:11.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可仍旧声望很高 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}yet beloved by many.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.20,0:18:14.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,获取他的支持 对我们进军政坛至关重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His support would all but secure office.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.73,0:18:16.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他去罗马有要事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Pressing affairs draw him to Rome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.23,0:18:20.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这可不妙啊 Ilithyia\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That does not bring comfort Ilithyia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.10,0:18:24.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果他出席的话 你就宽心了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then perhaps his attendance shall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.00,0:18:25.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他会推迟启程\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He will delay travel,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.20,0:18:28.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只为来参加你的庆典\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with mind towards your celebration.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.13,0:18:29.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是怎样让他改变主意的呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How did you turn his attentions?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.96,0:18:31.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他青睐于我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He favors me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.13,0:18:34.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大多数身为人夫者 都垂涎于我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Most husbands do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.06,0:18:42.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很感谢你的帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your services have been deeply appreciated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.86,0:18:44.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可仍有一事相求\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet more is needed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.43,0:18:46.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你尊敬的丈夫没有出席\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In the absence of your honored husband,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.43,0:18:47.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以请你代替我们这位最尊贵的客人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}we would have you address{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.86,0:18:49.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,作简短致辞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}our most noble guests.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.70,0:18:53.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只需以他的角度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Just a few words as if fallen from his mouth,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.93,0:18:56.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,称颂Batiatus家族的美德即可\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}extolling the virtues of the House of Batiatus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.76,0:19:00.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会好好构思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I shall compose something appropriate{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.16,0:19:01.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该如何致辞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for the occasion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.16,0:19:02.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.16,0:19:03.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经为你写好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've already seen to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.00,0:19:10.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不仅行动受限\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My hands are no longer my own{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.86,0:19:14.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如今你连我说什么都要操纵吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and now you seize my fucking tongue?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.16,0:19:16.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可不想让你说些不着边际的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would not have it flap about, absent direction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.06,0:19:20.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你对我的侮辱 什么时候是个头呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How much longer must I suffer your indignities?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.36,0:19:23.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要我还有一口气 你就躲不了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}While breath gives life to my command.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.00,0:19:31.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就如你所愿吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As you wish, then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.93,0:19:35.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道我们之间关系一度紧张\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know there have been tensions between us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.86,0:19:39.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可我们如今何必给双方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet I see no cause for our current arrangement{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.70,0:19:42.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带来不快呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to fall into unpleasantness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.73,0:19:46.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们曾是那么亲近的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We were such dear friends once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.13,0:19:48.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不想重塑我们的友谊吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Would you not see it so again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.96,0:19:53.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,若我能扭转乾坤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Would that I had power to reverse the sun,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.20,0:19:56.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,使世界恢复原样 我就与你和好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and restore the world to its proper place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.76,0:20:21.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,稍事休息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.70,0:20:23.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去吃饭吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Eat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.90,0:20:26.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正午过后 我们再开始训练\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We resume after midday sun has past.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.66,0:20:49.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你动作很敏捷嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You move well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.10,0:20:52.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像没被鞭打过一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As if lash had never struck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.13,0:20:55.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把痛苦转嫁给别人之后 自己就没事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Pain is erased, when inflicted upon others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.56,0:20:56.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望在我们交战之时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would have you at your best{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.23,0:20:57.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你出于最佳状态\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}when we face each other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.36,0:20:58.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是你全部的愿望吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is that all you'd have from me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.86,0:21:01.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Rhasko和我提起了你的愿望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Rhasko speaks of your desires.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.10,0:21:02.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是不脑子缺根弦啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What fever grips brain,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.36,0:21:05.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我怎么可能和你一个鼻孔出气呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that Spartacus would think me to band with him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.16,0:21:07.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而使我的勇士们命悬一线?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To risk the lives of my men?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.00,0:21:08.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有我的生命?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My life?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.46,0:21:10.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果没有你心爱的女人?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is there one?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.00,0:21:12.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还能活下去吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Without the woman you love within it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.63,0:21:17.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我生存的最大动力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've never had stronger reason to live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.66,0:21:19.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道你的心愿 Crixus\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know your heart, Crixus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.90,0:21:22.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也曾牵挂我此生挚爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I felt the beating of it within my chest once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.63,0:21:25.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你该知道 我绝对会存活下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then you know I'll fucking survive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.76,0:21:27.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,与Naevia重逢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And see Naevia returned to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.83,0:21:29.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像我妻子与我重逢那样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As my wife was returned?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.53,0:21:33.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Batiatus下令杀了她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Batiatus ordered her death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.30,0:21:40.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么知道的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How did you come upon this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.10,0:21:41.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是他的走狗Aulus亲口所说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}By tongue of his man Aulus,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.83,0:21:43.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之后我就送他上西天了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}before silencing it forever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.96,0:21:47.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要亲眼目睹Batiatus家族分崩离析\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will see the House of Batiatus fall,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.80,0:21:50.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让整个庄园陷入血海\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and with it the villain's blood upon the earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.96,0:21:53.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要是你 也会这样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As would I, in your position.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.06,0:21:54.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可我与你不同\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But I am far removed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.80,0:21:56.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我逃出去 对Naevia有害无利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My escape would not aid Naevia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.86,0:21:58.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是我被罗马人追击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How would I purchase her freedom,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.16,0:21:59.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我又该怎样为她赎回自由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}or even find her,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.66,0:22:01.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或是找到她呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}while being hunted like a dog by the Romans?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.43,0:22:02.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加入我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Join me,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.60,0:22:06.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们一起去寻找她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and we will find her together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.80,0:22:13.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道 若在来生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know that in another life,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.66,0:22:15.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们可能会情如手足的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you and I may have been as brothers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.03,0:22:21.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可这是在今生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But not in this one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.76,0:22:25.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我必须在竞技场上赢得自由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I must win my freedom in the arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.20,0:22:28.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们就是彼此的障碍了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then we stand in the way of each other's cause.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.03,0:22:29.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而我们所做的均是正义之举\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And both are just.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.53,0:22:34.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可若我倒下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But if I fall,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.16,0:22:36.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要你答应我 去找Naevia\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'd have you swear to find Naevia{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.46,0:22:38.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并让她恢复自由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and see her freed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.96,0:22:41.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要你胜利了 我就答应你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I would have word that if you are victorious,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.96,0:22:45.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总有一天 你会手刃Batiatus的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}one day you will have Batiatus' life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.96,0:22:53.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就明天吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tomorrow, then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.43,0:22:56.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们必须死一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One of us dies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.30,0:22:59.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恐怕注定就是如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I fear it was always fated so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.63,0:23:14.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,主人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dominus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.70,0:23:19.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你弄到我们明天需要的东西了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Were you able to procure what we need for tomorrow?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.70,0:23:22.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老Marcellus总是乐于相助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good Marcellus was ever helpful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.80,0:23:25.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,退下吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Leave us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.53,0:23:29.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Varro的眼光不错嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Varro possessed a fine eye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.93,0:23:31.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谈谈生意的事情吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Turn yours towards business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.93,0:23:33.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从Marcellus那儿买到了什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What has coin extracted from Marcellus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.93,0:23:37.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个解决麻烦问题的方法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A solution to most vexing problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.26,0:23:38.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在他杯子里滴上几滴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A few drops in his cup,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.60,0:23:40.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就万事大吉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and fate is sealed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.23,0:23:41.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是可别把他杀了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It must not kill him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.43,0:23:42.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,必须让我们的客人相信 比赛是公平的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Our guests need to believe the match balanced,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.80,0:23:45.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以免把事情给搞砸了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}lest goodwill turn to accusation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.40,0:23:47.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它只会让Crixus变虚弱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It will but weaken Crixus,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.03,0:23:49.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让斯巴达克斯占得上风\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}allowing Spartacus advantage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.63,0:23:52.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这可真是神奇啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is a marvel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.50,0:23:56.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如此微小的东西 却能让一段传奇覆灭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That something so slight could topple a legend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.03,0:23:58.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人总是会倒下的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All men fall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.63,0:24:01.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是时间和方式不同罢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is but time and method that differ.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.53,0:24:05.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,务必完成\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}See it done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.53,0:24:08.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次行动 就是那该死高卢人的死期\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And in the act, the end of that fucking Gaul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.30,0:24:26.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Crixus的动作非常犀利啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Crixus moves with deadly purpose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.83,0:24:28.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他跟斯巴达克斯的表演\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He gives much better showing against Spartacus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.36,0:24:29.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可比跟蠢Varro的好多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}than the fool Varro.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.60,0:24:31.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可怜的Varro啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Poor Varro.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.30,0:24:34.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他根本没有赢的机会 不是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He never stood proper chance, did he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.06,0:24:40.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可Crixus 不管怎样 都能对那战神的头衔和性命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Crixus, however, threatens to strip the champion{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.33,0:24:42.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,构成绝对的威胁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of life and title.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.36,0:24:44.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,确实如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.76,0:24:46.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,高卢人还真令人吃惊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Gaul yet surprises.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.26,0:24:48.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至死方休\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To the very end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.03,0:25:10.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恕罪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Apologies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.03,0:25:42.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(当天早晨)
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.63,0:25:47.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尊贵的Batiatus家族依然谦逊...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The noble House of Batiatus stands humbled...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.86,0:25:51.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是受到了众神早已安排好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Humbled by the fortunes the gods have seen fit{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.06,0:25:52.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,财运眷顾啊...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to shower upon us...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.46,0:25:54.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得应该说是"好运" 吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I should use "blessings" instead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.80,0:25:57.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"财运" 只能指代钱财\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"Fortune" has but connotation of coin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.20,0:25:59.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就 好运吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Blessings, then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.86,0:26:06.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 Quintus 城里还能有第二个像你这般的男人吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, Quintus, has this city yet beheld such a man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.03,0:26:10.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你父亲一定非常骄傲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your father would be so proud.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.00,0:26:12.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那老混蛋肯定会嫉妒死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The old bastard would have cracked with jealously,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.63,0:26:15.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我这不足道的儿子 让他黯然失色\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to be so eclipsed by unworthy son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.00,0:26:17.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他爱你啊 Quintus\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He loved you, Quintus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.46,0:26:19.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他从没相信过我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet he never believed in me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.86,0:26:21.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果他能活着 看见Batiatus家族在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Would that he were alive to see the House of Batiatus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.63,0:26:24.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的双翼之下崛起 那该多好啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}soaring beneath the flapping of my wings!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.93,0:26:28.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的儿子将继承强大的权势!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Our son shall inherit a fucking empire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.36,0:26:29.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又成权势了 是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}An empire now, is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.96,0:26:31.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃 地基已经建好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Eh, the foundations already laid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.60,0:26:33.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天我们将筑起大厦!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Today we build upon it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.66,0:26:35.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯和Crixus!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus and Crixus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.00,0:26:37.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两位宿敌 将面对生与死的对决!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hated foes, facing each other in death!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.40,0:26:41.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,整个国家的人都将无比羡慕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The whole of the Republic shall whisper with envy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.03,0:26:43.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这只有少数人才能见证的盛况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}what so privileged few bore witness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.53,0:26:47.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它将被永载于史册\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It will be a thing not soon forgotten.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.70,0:26:53.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我怕你的决心不够啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I fear your resolve grows soft.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.46,0:26:55.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,足够了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.46,0:26:58.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是希望能够做个了断\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I but wish an end to the matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.13,0:26:59.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对于他自己也是如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And to the man himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.90,0:27:02.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Ashur已经做到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ashur already attends to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.43,0:27:05.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将不幸的过去抛掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Turn thoughts from unfortunate past,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.10,0:27:07.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用将来的荣耀来补偿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and fix on glorious future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.23,0:27:27.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些庆典会让大家兴奋得发抖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}These celebrations can cause hands to tremble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.30,0:27:31.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再老练的人也无法抗拒啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Even most practiced ones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.33,0:27:32.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非常感谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gratitude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.60,0:27:34.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要紧张\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}See nerves calmed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.10,0:27:36.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会做得很好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You'll do well here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.06,0:27:38.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能感觉得到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have a feeling of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.16,0:27:42.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你被允许和主人坐在一起享用晚餐?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are allowed to eat from your master's table?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.33,0:27:45.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我这是为强大的Crixus与战神决斗之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I prepare this as a tribute to the mighty Crixus,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.43,0:27:47.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对他的一种致敬吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}before his match against the champion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.40,0:27:49.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 愿众神保佑他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}May the gods bless it, then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.23,0:27:51.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并且赐予他力量 杀掉斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And give him strength to kill Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.36,0:27:53.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可不会瞎祈祷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would save prayer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.96,0:27:59.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不认为斯巴达克斯今天就会死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I do not believe Spartacus will fall this day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.56,0:28:04.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我听说Crixus在火神节的竞技场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have heard Crixus bested him once in the arena,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.03,0:28:06.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赢过他一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}at the Vulcanalia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.16,0:28:07.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是什么让你觉得这次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What leads you to certainty{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.26,0:28:08.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会出现一样的情况?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}against similar outcome?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.80,0:28:09.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们这里的很多事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am certain of many things{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.86,0:28:11.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我都能肯定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}within these walls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.83,0:28:16.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的美丽如此出众\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your beauty among them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.56,0:28:17.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Aurelia啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Aurelia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.76,0:28:19.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,训练场上有人找你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are needed in the square.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.03,0:29:00.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,待在我身边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stay to my side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.33,0:29:01.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要走开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do not stray from it,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.43,0:29:02.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想看着你活着出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and I will see you beyond these walls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.60,0:29:04.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我又不是小孩子了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I do not need you to hold hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.26,0:29:06.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只想保护你安全啊 你他妈的傻子!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I only wish your life protected, you fucking cock!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.93,0:29:09.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,声音再大点 我们都会没命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Speak louder, and see us all undone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.33,0:29:14.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈 我真想把他该死的鞭子弄走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ha, I would have his fucking whip removed,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.23,0:29:16.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有那条挥鞭子的臂膀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}along with the arm that wields it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.36,0:29:18.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Doctore是个可敬的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Doctore is an honorable man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.16,0:29:21.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不想让他死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would not have him dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.63,0:29:22.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奴隶也一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nor any slave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.70,0:29:24.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还真悲天悯人啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You fret of shit and piss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.43,0:29:25.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有Crixus Rhaskos和其他人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Rhaskos and the others{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.60,0:29:27.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是不会死心塌地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}still will not fall to purpose without Crixus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.70,0:29:29.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们会抓住时机的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They will seize the moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.73,0:29:31.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Crixus死了的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Crixus is dead,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.76,0:29:33.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就只有一位战神了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and there stands but one champion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.63,0:29:44.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Doctore啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Doctore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.00,0:29:46.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喝水?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Water?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.06,0:30:08.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们庆典一般疏于防范\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}These celebrations have habit of turning from control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.93,0:30:10.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果还这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Should they again,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.80,0:30:13.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就搬去安全的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}remove to a safe place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.63,0:30:15.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不存在安全的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}None exist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.10,0:30:18.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自从Varro被你亲手杀死之后 就再没有了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not since Varro was taken from me by your hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.96,0:30:20.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正因如此 我对这种行径一直鄙视\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I shall forever despise it for the deed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.06,0:30:24.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,包括下命令的那个声音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In company with the voice that commanded it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.00,0:30:25.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在怪Batiatus\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You blame Batiatus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.56,0:30:26.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为很多事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For many things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.66,0:30:28.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但不是这件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But not this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.43,0:30:32.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是Numerius那小子下令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It was the boy Numerius who demanded{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.90,0:30:35.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把简单的竞技变成了惨案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}simple sport end in death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.70,0:30:42.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我就该相信一个 为达目的不择手段的人吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I should believe a man that would do anything to win?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.63,0:30:50.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要把我当傻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do not take me a fool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.23,0:30:52.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Ashur为Crixus准备了午餐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ashur prepares meal for Crixus,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.86,0:30:55.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还说你必胜无疑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and speaks of the certainty of your fucking victory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.63,0:30:57.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们在食物下毒?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They corrupt his food?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.83,0:30:59.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对Varro不也是一样吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Was it the same for Varro?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.80,0:31:01.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你才能赢他?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is that how you bested him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.83,0:31:06.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这跟我没关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have no hand in this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.50,0:31:12.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即便如此 我还是希望Crixus\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Were that true, I would still pray Crixus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.83,0:31:15.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能在倒下之前 亲手把你解决了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}takes your life before he falls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.50,0:31:36.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你背叛了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You betrayed me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.53,0:31:41.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我知道 错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet I've come to see that the fault{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.56,0:31:43.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不在你自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}is not your own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.16,0:31:46.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能因为你太软弱而责备你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You cannot be blamed for being weak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.46,0:31:51.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有男人面对诱惑 都一样软弱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All men are, when faced with wet opportunity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.86,0:31:55.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以忘却这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would put it behind us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.46,0:31:59.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,作为回报 我只要真心话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All I ask in return is the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.86,0:32:07.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉我 Naevia对你毫无意义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tell me Naevia held no meaning for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.76,0:32:12.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要我说假话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You ask me to speak with false tongue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.80,0:32:17.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就当是为了我们的孩子不行吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What would it conjure for our child?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.26,0:32:18.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孩子?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Child?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.66,0:32:21.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,木早已成舟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Seed has at last taken hold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.80,0:32:25.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上帝保佑了我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The gods bless us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.63,0:32:28.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得我是父亲?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You would divine me as father?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.26,0:32:30.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是主人的吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not Dominus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.10,0:32:33.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我感受到战神的血液\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I feel the blood of a champion,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.60,0:32:35.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在我体内膨胀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}swelling inside me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.40,0:32:37.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Crixus 我感受到了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I feel you, Crixus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.46,0:32:41.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我经常想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have often dreamt,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.76,0:32:45.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过得平淡点 有个孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in quiet moments of having a child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.96,0:32:49.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过 是和Naevia一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}With Naevia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.46,0:32:55.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们之间也没什么好说的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There is nothing left between us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.60,0:33:06.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Crixus啊...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Crixus...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.93,0:33:12.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真没想过 会如此收场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I didn't intend for it to end this way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.66,0:33:40.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Crixus开始谢幕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Crixus begins to fade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.60,0:33:42.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正如所有回忆一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As all memories do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.20,0:33:52.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你变弱了 是因为他们对你下了毒!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're weakened because they have poisoned you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.93,0:33:54.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干掉他!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Finish him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.33,0:33:56.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们都希望你死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They wish you dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.63,0:34:13.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真不想如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would not have this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.06,0:34:22.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加入我吧 兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Join me, brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.66,0:34:27.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我们一起见证Batiatus家族的覆灭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And we shall see the House of Batiatus fall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.03,0:34:33.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干掉那条狗!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Kill the dog!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.60,0:34:55.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.30,0:35:02.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Argh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.20,0:35:39.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀死他们!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Kill them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.73,0:35:41.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个不留!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Kill them all!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.10,0:35:49.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诸位 不要惊慌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do not be alarmed people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.40,0:35:52.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一切都在我们掌控之中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Everything is under control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.30,0:35:53.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请便吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.53,0:35:54.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他想杀你啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He tried to kill you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.66,0:35:55.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那该死的畜生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That fucking animal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.90,0:35:57.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们必须稳定局势!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We must calm this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.40,0:35:59.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死的守卫都哪去了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where are the fucking guards?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.36,0:36:01.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还站那儿干嘛?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why do you stand there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.53,0:36:03.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,召集你的人马!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gather your men!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.00,0:36:08.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我希望你自己好生保重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I shall see you properly attended.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.56,0:36:25.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Argh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.60,0:36:41.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Hamilcar啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hamilcar!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.10,0:36:55.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Crixus啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Crixus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.66,0:37:00.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做什么傻事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What is this madness?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.03,0:37:02.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯给我们指引了道路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus shows us the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.56,0:37:04.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他就是条毫无尊严的狗!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He is a dog without honor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.16,0:37:06.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是这个家族毫无尊严!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This house is without honor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.43,0:37:08.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Batiatus处死了他的妻子!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Batiatus ordered his wife dead!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.70,0:37:10.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而主人...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And Domina...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.10,0:37:11.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她辱没我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She has tainted me,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.10,0:37:13.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是因为我刺痛了她的心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}because I spur her fucking heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.86,0:37:16.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我将此生都献给了这训练场!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have given my life to this ludus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.73,0:37:18.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 是他们让你变成了奴隶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, they stole it from you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.40,0:37:20.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们也是如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}From all of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.40,0:37:22.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要我信任你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You asked me to put faith in you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.23,0:37:24.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你也要信任我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I ask the same.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.73,0:37:27.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,献身荣耀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Honor us all,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.10,0:37:29.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,屠灭这肮脏的家族\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and see an end of this fucking house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.20,0:37:40.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.40,0:38:22.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.60,0:38:39.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我为你赢取这一刻 兄弟...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I save you this time, brother...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.63,0:39:08.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ahhh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.16,0:39:11.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朋友们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.66,0:39:13.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,庄园之内 绝对安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We are perfectly safe inside the villa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.96,0:39:15.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现下形势尚在处理!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The situation is being attended!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.50,0:39:16.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们无需惊慌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Still your hearts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.73,0:39:19.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的卫兵目前无疑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This very moment my guards are no doubt{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.33,0:39:20.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正在处理...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}dealing with these...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.20,0:39:23.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们都疯了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They've lost mind!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.10,0:39:53.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Ilithyia在他妈哪儿?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where the fuck is Ilithyia?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.90,0:39:55.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我来! 我们离开这里!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come! Let us away!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.83,0:40:00.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把门都封上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Seal the doors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.30,0:40:01.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,任何人不得从此通过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let no one beyond them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.30,0:40:02.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那客人们呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What of the guests?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.30,0:40:04.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是副将的妻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am the wife of the Legatus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.10,0:40:06.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快他妈把门封上!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Seal the fucking doors!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.46,0:40:15.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Ilithyia啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ilithyia!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.33,0:40:26.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把门打开!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Open the doors!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.43,0:40:48.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还记得我在这间屋子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you recall what I said{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.40,0:40:50.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说过什么吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in this very room?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.13,0:40:53.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说 如果Barca的离去另有隐情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That if there was more to Barca's departure,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.73,0:40:56.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们可得好好聊聊了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you and I would share words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.43,0:41:01.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Doctore啊...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Doctore...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.63,0:41:05.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你他妈闭嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do not fucking speak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.00,0:41:07.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看到你们窃窃私语\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have seen you play tongue upon ear,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.20,0:41:09.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘀咕下毒的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}whispering poison.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.20,0:41:11.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,败坏家族荣耀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Infecting the honor of this house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.90,0:41:14.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想杀我这样一个手无寸铁的人吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You would kill a defenseless man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.70,0:41:17.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么做有狗屁荣耀可言?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where is the fucking honor in that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.03,0:41:19.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我倒要看看教给你的 你是否还记得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let's see if you recall what I taught you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.26,0:41:21.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那时你还算是个男人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When you were yet a man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.30,0:41:29.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,门...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The doors...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.10,0:41:31.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,门...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The doors...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.96,0:41:33.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Glaber副将的手下...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Glaber's men...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.66,0:41:35.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把门封上了...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}sealed the doors...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.03,0:41:36.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是Ilithyia\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ilithyia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.20,0:41:37.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她怎么会做这种事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why would she do such a thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.43,0:41:39.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,母亲!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mother!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.86,0:41:53.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Quintus... 走!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Quintus... Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.43,0:41:55.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快走!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.20,0:41:56.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.56,0:42:02.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来啊 你们这些罗马贱女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come here you Roman pussies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.23,0:42:05.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们都会死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We are all of us dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.46,0:42:07.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 我们家族会东山再起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No. We will regain this House.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.33,0:42:11.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带好Numerius 隐蔽起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Take Numerius, conceal yourselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.06,0:42:12.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.06,0:42:13.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道一个地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know a place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.36,0:42:15.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要去哪儿啊?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where do you go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.66,0:42:17.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去我丈夫那儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To my husband.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.03,0:42:22.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯真该碎尸万段\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And the death of Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.20,0:42:31.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悲惨至极\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Pathetic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.70,0:42:34.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以为这有何不同吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You think this will cause difference?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.06,0:42:38.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,纵然生命凋零\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Even if life fades,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.80,0:42:41.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的双手却依旧强大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}my hand shall yet be felt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.30,0:42:45.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Barca之死便是拜它所赐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It plotted the death of Barca.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.30,0:42:47.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它见证了行政官命毙黄泉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Saw the Magistrate's end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.56,0:42:51.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,甚至迫使Glaber副将掏出了赞助费\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It even helped force Glaber to patronage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.33,0:42:56.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这家族的每一分每一寸 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Every beam, every stone in this fucking house{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.26,0:42:59.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都烙有Ashur的印记!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}bears the mark of Ashur!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.03,0:43:02.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,仅烙下了你的背叛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It bears only your treachery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.03,0:43:08.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我他妈背叛?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My fucking treachery?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.66,0:43:13.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你什么时候为我Ashur说过话?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When did you stand forth for Ashur?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.63,0:43:18.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,平日你们谁不对我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When did any of you greet me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.03,0:43:20.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冷嘲热讽 嗤之以鼻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}short of mockery and scorn,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.33,0:43:24.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们这些狗杂碎!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}fucking cunts!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.30,0:43:30.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是你应得的下场!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You received what you deserved!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.30,0:43:32.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们出卖了Barca和其他所有人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For Barca and all the others that you have betrayed,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.83,0:43:35.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如今你的死期已致\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}your time is done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.53,0:43:48.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能让我死在竞技场上吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Would that this were the arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.23,0:43:51.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的血会辱没沙场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your blood would dishonor the sand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.16,0:43:54.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就送我上路吧 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Send me on my way, then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.96,0:43:57.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我像角斗士一样死去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As you would a Gladiator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.80,0:44:02.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求你 Doctore\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Please, Doctore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.20,0:44:06.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,临终前的仁慈...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A parting kindness...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.76,0:44:31.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Ashur 你妈的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ashur!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.10,0:44:34.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Ashur 我操你妈!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ashur!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.90,0:45:12.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Quintus啊...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Quintus...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.73,0:45:15.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是Quintus吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Quintus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.00,0:45:18.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说对了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You were right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.20,0:45:25.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你我之间 还有事情尚未解决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There is still something between you and I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.80,0:45:29.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Naevia在哪儿?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where is Naevia?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.53,0:45:33.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在哪儿?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.20,0:45:37.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带我和主人离开庄园\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}See me and the Dominus out of the villa{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.83,0:45:39.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and I will tell you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.50,0:45:45.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不相信你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I do not believe you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.33,0:45:48.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求你...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Please...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.56,0:45:50.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Crixus啊...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Crixus...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.46,0:45:55.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的孩子...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}our child...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.06,0:46:02.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我宁可看着他死掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would rather see it dead,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.83,0:46:06.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不愿意看你为他哺乳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}than suckle your breast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.73,0:46:38.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们必须藏起来...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We must conceal ourselves...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.00,0:46:51.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是你下的令吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Was it yours?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.26,0:46:53.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那细小的声音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That small, little voice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.43,0:46:58.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正是那样的轻声细语 就夺走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did it form the words that robbed Varro{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.20,0:46:59.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Varro的生命吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of his life?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.20,0:47:00.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说Varro?!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Varro?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.46,0:47:04.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他本就该死!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He deserved to die!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.93,0:47:06.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他什么也不是!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He was nothing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.90,0:47:12.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道他什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What did you know of the man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.86,0:47:16.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道他可以 为臂弯里入睡的孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That he would sing to his child,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.30,0:47:21.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,轻轻唱出摇篮曲吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}sleeping in his arms?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.16,0:47:23.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当我情绪不佳时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Or kiss the tears from my cheek,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.43,0:47:25.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他会吻去我颊边的泪水?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}when I was of a mood?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.83,0:47:28.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道父亲的含义吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did you know the father?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.93,0:47:31.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,丈夫的责任吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The husband?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.43,0:47:40.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不是一个完美的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He was not a perfect man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.70,0:47:46.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他是我的男人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But he was mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.53,0:47:50.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是我的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He was mine!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.20,0:47:51.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是我的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He was mine!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.63,0:47:52.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呀!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yaaa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.63,0:47:53.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是我的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He was mine!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.63,0:47:56.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的! 我的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mine! Mine!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.56,0:47:57.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ahhh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.53,0:48:03.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He was mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.16,0:48:04.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呀!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yaaa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.16,0:48:06.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mine...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.40,0:48:08.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Aurelia啊...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Aurelia...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.56,0:48:11.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别激动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Be still.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.90,0:48:14.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.70,0:48:28.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,照看下这个女孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Look to the girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.66,0:48:31.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这还不够吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is this not enough?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.03,0:48:33.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还要死多少人?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How many more must die?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.03,0:48:34.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只想看一个人死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would see but one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.26,0:48:40.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是你们的主人!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am your Dominus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.33,0:48:42.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要把你们该死的黑心肠都挖出来!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will have your fucking hearts!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.16,0:48:47.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Quintus啊...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Quintus...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.50,0:48:55.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Lucretia啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lucretia!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.13,0:48:59.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想做什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What would you do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.70,0:49:01.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再次将妻子拥入怀中?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To hold your wife again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.03,0:49:05.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再次感受她肌肤的温度?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To feel the warmth of her skin?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.23,0:49:09.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她双唇的味道?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The taste of her lips?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.06,0:49:11.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还要杀多少人?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How many men would you kill?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.53,0:49:13.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一百?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A hundred?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.76,0:49:16.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一千?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A thousand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.46,0:49:17.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有一人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There stands but one,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.63,0:49:20.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,横亘在你和她之间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}between you and her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.23,0:49:31.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去找她吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Go to her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.50,0:49:36.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉她 就算是天神自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tell her the gods themselves{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.90,0:49:38.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不能将你们分开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}would not keep you apart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.16,0:49:40.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,撒谎!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.96,0:49:45.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像你说我妻子的谎话一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As you lied to me of my wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.20,0:49:49.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Oenemaus啊...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oenemaus...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.93,0:50:02.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在我面前什么也不是!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You were nothing before me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.80,0:50:06.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我给了你一切!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I gave you everything!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.13,0:50:09.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我给你出路 让你接受自己命运!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I gave you the means to accept your fate!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.30,0:50:16.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在 你将被命运所毁灭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And now you are destroyed by it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.43,0:50:58.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我做这件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have done this thing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.60,0:51:00.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是为了正义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}because it is just.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.73,0:51:04.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,血债血偿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Blood demands blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.16,0:51:11.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们活着 却很困惑 长久以来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We have lived and lost,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.60,0:51:14.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一直被主人的反复无常所羁绊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}at the whims of our masters for too long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.26,0:51:18.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会再任其继续\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would not have it so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.73,0:51:24.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不愿意再看到 为了娱乐的目的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would not see the passing of a brother{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.83,0:51:27.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而牺牲掉自己的兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for the purpose of sport.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.46,0:51:32.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不愿意再看到 毫无因由 就挖出别人的心脏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would not see another heart ripped from chest,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.20,0:51:34.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或随意致人死地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}or breath forfeit for no cause.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.76,0:51:38.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道 并不是你们所有人都希望如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know not all of you wished this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.73,0:51:42.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是已经做了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet it is done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.33,0:51:46.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.56,0:51:49.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们的性命在自己手里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your lives are your own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.43,0:51:51.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各走各路...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Forge your own path...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.76,0:51:54.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或者加入我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}or join with us,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.53,0:51:58.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们一起 震撼整个罗马\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and together we shall see Rome tremble.{\r}
